# Gogo, Master of Mimicry: "This ability can't be copied and X can't be 0." With Walking Ballista's ping at Bot2 on the stack and
# mana to spare, Gogo with X = 0 is refused. Gogo with X = 1 targets the ping, and Echo, Perceptive Prodigy (copy target ability
# you control from a creature source) targets Gogo's ability in response: Echo resolves and copies nothing (CR 101.2, 707.10), so
# only Gogo's ability and the ping are left on the stack. Gogo then copies the ping once: Bot2 takes 2, not 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Gogo, Master of Mimicry
Echo, Perceptive Prodigy
Walking Ballista
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

